      "title": "z21: Add some heuristics",
      "message": "z21: Add some heuristics\n\nThe Z21 LAN protocol uses unregistered ports 21105 and 21106.\nAdd some heuristics so that it doesn't dissect everything on\nthat port by default.\n",
